name: sim.removeModel
description: Removes a model from the scene
luaSynopsis: int removedCnt = sim.removeModel(int objectHandle, bool delayedRemoval = False)
pythonSynopsis: int removedCnt = sim.removeModel(int objectHandle, bool delayedRemoval = false)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the model (i.e. object tagged as model) to remove
2. delayedRemoval: whether the removal should be delayed (e.g. when a script destroys itself). Defaults to false
outputs:
1. removedCnt: number of removed objects (a model might contain several objects)
replacedBy:
- name: removeObjects, class: scene, file: scene_removeObjects.method
- name: removeModel, class: sceneObject, file: sceneObject_removeModel.method
